# Copy to .env and fill in. Both variables are SERVER-side only.
#
# Note the deliberate absence of a VITE_ prefix: Vite inlines any VITE_-prefixed
# variable straight into the client bundle, which would publish the key to every
# visitor. These are read only by api/generate.ts.

# Required. Create one at https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys
# Set a credit limit on the key while you are there.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free, which costs nothing.
# Set this to a paid model for better BG3 rules accuracy — see the README table.
# Whatever you pick must support structured outputs and should not be a
# reasoning model; reasoning tokens eat the max_tokens budget.
OPENROUTER_MODEL=
